*.a binary
*.bmp binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.exe binary
*.fbx binary
*.gif binary
*.gz binary
*.ico binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.lib binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.so binary
*.uasset binary
*.umap binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
